---
title: "emergencyWithdraw (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_transfer: caller authorized
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(token, recipient, amount), emit EmergencyWithdrawal

    note right of q_check_auth
        INV-001: only Legion operators can perform emergency withdrawals
        INV-002: emergency withdraw bypasses normal sale flow checks
    end note
